{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "4c19e271f5c32b8115b113b924e4fcb8d4952f7d489831c594a3416830b7cebc", "ja": "バラバラのフォトグラフ", "zh": "破碎的相片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6ea1e4b1cdde90b40128a522229a72c006cc1547fb7e9c438503b80a020e2f6a", "ja": "練習にぎりぎりでやってくる亜利沙。その\n理由は、前日、徹夜でアルバムの整理をして\nいたからだと言う。桃子が怒ると、亜利沙は\nしょげて部屋を出ていってしまう。プロデュ\nーサーは春香と一緒に亜利沙を追う。", "zh": "亚利沙在练习开始前才匆忙赶到。\n原因是她前一天在熬夜整理相簿。\n被桃子骂了之后，亚利沙难过的离开练习室。\n制作人和春香一起去追亚利沙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d5489e5618803c79ae023a1e997f0d0836ddc75653e13710dd403f71f6e454c9", "ja": "（リコッタのレッスンも、そろそろ佳境だ。\n今日は久しぶりに、全員そろう予定だが……）", "zh": "（『Ricotta』的训练课程渐入佳境。\n许久未齐聚的成员，今天预定聚在一起练习，但……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "42744063aa46eedafee67ce9bd3436a11f629a7a1eea3381309d75b4878812a0", "ja": "おはよう、お兄ちゃん。", "zh": "早安，大哥哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5ba2f39ae17501b56988d8d35d42ec76ad993785fdaac3d091d34373a62f9545", "ja": "おはよう桃子、もう来てたのか。\nいつも早いんだな。", "zh": "早安桃子，你已经到了啊。\n你总是很早来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "33104f8fe86c4148d5491bdc7c3d114e77e74606c417aa96d679b6c967f956a7", "ja": "この前のレッスン、お仕事でお休みしちゃったから。\n桃子、みんなよりちょっと遅れ気味だし……。", "zh": "之前的训练课程因为工作没办法参加。\n桃子觉得比大家落后了一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "88b70bc382e92c519a0e193acc1c35c07fce8da69c7e30f1e5c695d944af293e", "ja": "桃子は、リコッタの指導係なんだもん。\nみんなの中で、一番上手じゃないとね！", "zh": "毕竟桃子是『Ricotta』的小老师，\n所以一定得比大家做得更好才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1005_p", "source_sha256": "85dfc90f160ff22f4645a7e575eb2ade88161b48b8d4219ac93a38f680de1847", "ja": "そうか、桃子は頑張り屋だな。\nでもあんまり無理しないようにな？", "zh": "这样啊，桃子真是勤奋，\n但可别太勉强自己啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "9df5249eac1cd54fb68ed979c97f516d74676eb7e4bb0767b7e743cd7eabce07", "ja": "お兄ちゃん？　桃子達はプロなんだから、\nこれくらい頑張るのは、当然でしょ。", "zh": "大哥哥，桃子我们可是专业的，\n付出这点程度的努力也是理所当然的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "123901067b66ec55e9a6ce439c738bbfe7ecd1b61559ab2b0e6852a76e40efdb", "ja": "リコッタのみんなだって、桃子を頼ってるんだし。\n5人でお客さんに、すごいステージを見せなくちゃ！", "zh": "『Ricotta』的大家也很仰赖桃子，\n因此我们五个人一定要让观众看到最棒的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "11da79dd5115a75202cb1bddede79af52a94fdd2635a83ad0a2bd025d096508b", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん、桃子。\nおはよーさん！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生、桃子，\n早安呀──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "f1919cdd041a7c2c38147629d860fffc07f941f23c67a064ef33c72156f5c427", "ja": "今日のレッスンも、気合い入れて行くよー！\n確か、春香が遅れて合流だったよね？", "zh": "今天的训练课程也要全力以赴唷──！\n我记得，春香好像会晚一点到是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "7d7ec5ff0ced80e280815e35e92289750a841b506f4ca0ae9ffda57230046aee", "ja": "うん、春香さんは忙しいからね。\nそれで、亜利沙さんは……。", "zh": "嗯，因为春香姊很忙。\n话说亚利沙姊呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "2a15e230208a22adb2179e718bcdb56eb3218adc476b0f40c52da1ab16a3311a", "ja": "おおお、おはようございますーっ！\nま、間に合いました……ヒィヒィ……。", "zh": "早早早、早安──！\n赶、赶上了……呼……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "caebb1445aafc8bfffe73051d572e1a767c5a8244b095db934acaa0a1be07032", "ja": "ちょっと、亜利沙さん？\nまた着替えもしないで……全然間に合ってないよ！", "zh": "等一下，亚利沙姊。\n连衣服都还没有换……你完全就是迟到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "ecbeb705d8a5a302c790d6b5094d8be5e28a331f9887d56126d4182a38afbe8d", "ja": "ふわぁっ！？　お、おはようございます、\n桃子ちゃんセンパイ！　あの、それがですね……。", "zh": "呼啊！？早、早安，小桃前辈！\n那个，这是因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "3bfe2221707a18f8831b15c270e47750e24edc2d518e7cb95a6c02e549a982be", "ja": "桃子、前にも言ったよね？　レッスンの時間ぴったりに\n来たら、着替えと準備の時間分、遅刻だって！", "zh": "桃子之前就说过了吧？如果赶在课程开始的时间才到，\n那换衣服跟准备花了多少时间，就等于迟到了多久！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "6a623e9eb97658cfc1d700112d723dd7eaa127960bcd404cb25c774f29a922e7", "ja": "だから亜利沙さんは遅刻！\nバツとして、レッスンには参加させないよ！", "zh": "所以亚利沙姊你迟到了！\n做为惩罚，不准你参加训练课程！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "920e644e595c4b17856b4dcf7714cf99df788e1b2538add4d9c9c758919cff60", "ja": "え、ええ～！？　そんなぁ……。", "zh": "咦、咦咦～！？怎么这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "804d1797c371c0454663e0dc2a4dd55fbe7cc7ae619844b75b0201dd9010edfa", "ja": "あー……桃子、それはちょっと厳しくない？", "zh": "呃……桃子，这么做会不会有点太严厉了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "3e78d4a8b503c0fa1e8a4932213118493113f82860dab8386a0cda5246558249", "ja": "せやで、桃子。\n亜利沙かて、前よりはだいぶ……。", "zh": "嘿呀，桃子。\n亚利沙比起之前已经……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "a365688008643578ba576101ba4a92636ac2296530582870bee992d024ec1574", "ja": "のり子さんと奈緒さんは、黙ってて！\n桃子は、亜利沙さんと話してるの！", "zh": "法子姊跟奈绪姊都不要插嘴！\n桃子是在跟亚利沙姊说话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "227b41950c2fe156ea58de0511e1da924472dd3ce202181dd157e65886875b30", "ja": "まあまあ。確かに亜利沙は遅刻が多いけど……\nでも、何か事情があるのかもしれないだろ？", "zh": "好了好了，虽然亚利沙的确很常迟到……\n不过她也可能是遇到了什么状况呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "418682a7c911f42504805e02451722fd7077073610d7bb29b686939faa82cc86", "ja": "事情？　……亜利沙さん、そうなの？", "zh": "状况？……亚利沙姊，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "e68be68eaeeab2ef396779c0b9e7107dc3f107ed6fdf79f92f6cd996f579e534", "ja": "あ、は、はい……。あの、桃子ちゃんセンパイ！\nまた遅刻しちゃって、本当にごめんなさいっ！", "zh": "啊，是、是的……那个，小桃前辈！\n亚利沙这次又迟到了，真的非常对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "5f7e50128ee5fd097101436ff093c8c8ee783a79c4b561f5d29874040e9c54bf", "ja": "ありさ、実はこれを作ってて……\nあの、桃子ちゃんにも見て欲しいんです！", "zh": "亚利沙其实是在做这个……\n那个，亚利沙也希望能给桃子看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "b957d0baf621271d46b645da6d530e2c338b78af4e76c9efe0a39993d067eb27", "ja": "え？　な、なに……？", "zh": "咦？什、什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "5d774efe1b575b14622d5c2c0602f107c2465647c97817fe9c72d1c2e377f359", "ja": "奈緒ちゃんものり子ちゃんも、見てください！　\nこれぞ、ありさデータベースです！", "zh": "奈绪跟小法，你们也一起来看！\n这个就是亚利沙资料库！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1026_043nor", "source_sha256": "ebe9c4b88b623a7a7637f98da71f0cc5c47e2e93439e1c07066fdb9b4ec783bf", "ja": "どれどれ？\n……これって、アタシたちの練習風景の写真？", "zh": "什么什么？\n……这个不是我们练习时的照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "7ceb4ad2a500edac6c0a147b680dacfb2b32d12d429a222a0219a6d8bed43aaf", "ja": "うわっ、ものすごい量やん！\nこれもしかして、メンバーごとにまとめてあるん？", "zh": "哇，数量好多呀！\n这些照片是不是还有依照每个成员分类整理呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "73c795b0492972777dc38ee76fd3b6615bfd0b37a371bf6fac7647c4a68355d2", "ja": "はいっ！　でも、それだけじゃないんですよ？\n曲とダンスごとにも、わけてあるんです！", "zh": "没错！不过还不只这样喔！\n亚利沙还依照曲子和舞蹈分门别类！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "2e4cb40b299d18a803aa3ce9359381d1fd8729f3d3c0331a553d9508ab33afe8", "ja": "これなら振り付けやフォーメーションで\n不安なところを、バッチリおさらいできちゃいます！", "zh": "这样对舞蹈动作和表演队型没把握的地方，\n就可以一目了然了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "8e0a39937fabb0ca00ae1651d09457c2103a9cfdbe7f36b3b4d6b98523c03943", "ja": "すごい、なにこれ……。", "zh": "好厉害，这是什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1031_043nor", "source_sha256": "4fc946e4c5983c3e0205f2d55c97cebf340152a75cf9a5188c4807def95fe3e4", "ja": "ほんとだ、すごいよこの写真！\nああ、そうそう！　アタシ、ここ苦手なんだよね～。", "zh": "真的，这些照片太厉害了！\n啊，没错没错！这边我真的不太会～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "65484932b7fdf0d0209f1af55bc6a25c8224dffe57ec223dee625ebf905303e0", "ja": "なあ桃子！　さっそくやけど、\nこの写真参考にして、練習してみいひん？", "zh": "欸，桃子！\n我们要不要马上参考这些照片来练习呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "94279b3ab113d731e13836c72322161b1bd6fa5a0ef16aadcabc25b17d44a1a2", "ja": "もしかして……亜利沙さん、\nこれを作ってて、今日遅くなったの……？", "zh": "难道……亚利沙姊，\n你今天是为了做这个才迟到的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "fd2a109e9d96b0691b1bc6b6e18430b8cad4f3fd9721ebfb18b6bdbb83fb35a0", "ja": "エヘヘ……実は、そうなんです！　ありさ、\nこれを作るためにちょっぴり徹夜しちゃって……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……其实就是这样没错！\n亚利沙为了做这个稍微熬夜了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "e6a24ee1bea56d92bed2406f0c7e7d3dc99a91455d91f05fd5ab7c53387da4b9", "ja": "何それ……そんなの、聞いてないよ……。", "zh": "什么嘛……桃子可没听说啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1036_028ari", "source_sha256": "fac2e5a5b236ce9b88a37e63ac814b40990955aa395fbb5940d3f71b75c72fad", "ja": "桃子ちゃんセンパイ？", "zh": "小桃前辈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1037_049mom", "source_sha256": "26b666d2bb3ff1dfc8a416217ebccbcf69a44ae85c262e663a384f4ed19b92dd", "ja": "……亜利沙さん。たしかにこの写真はすごいけど、\n遅刻はダメだって桃子言ったよね？", "zh": "……亚利沙姊，虽然这些照片真的整理得很好，\n但是桃子之前已经说过不能迟到了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1038_049mom", "source_sha256": "efff5f0deb36a42113d07245157837afaf42bc7ef4492621b47715b8844e81c1", "ja": "それに、徹夜するなんて……プロなんだから、\n体調管理はちゃんとしなきゃ、ダメじゃない。", "zh": "而且居然还熬夜……你可是专业的，\n怎么可以这么不注重健康管理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "2bcd91052614c8e181f5835c12e23ec72de0069277ee42bc076b69bbf93d08e8", "ja": "だいたい、指導係は桃子なんだよ？　亜利沙さんの写真\nを参考にとか、こういうこと……勝手にされたら……。", "zh": "再说，桃子才是小老师，\n亚利沙姊擅自提供照片给大家参考……这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1040_028ari", "source_sha256": "0e4e6f8dbc7ed885cfb193fd7c07967dc5fc6faae3fd60deecebbf5d2f39d732", "ja": "も、桃子ちゃん……。", "zh": "桃、桃子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1041_049mom", "source_sha256": "1ba5750efb8795e845bf1113d323a2aa70b0e97eed277f3bb8875233a77c9b98", "ja": "桃子だって……レッスン、遅れてるのに……\nますます、追いつけなくなっちゃうよ……。", "zh": "桃子的课程进度……都已经落后了……\n这样就更追不上大家了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1042_028ari", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1043_p", "source_sha256": "a498b8d6c2f685e58ed61709eba36f4ccfe85b7808851ccdd7189d45518a541d", "ja": "桃子、それは……。", "zh": "桃子，这是因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1044_049mom", "source_sha256": "e6b6dccb1f0c174f03c1e7b3f039e77dc605887d6913454eaf6596609cb92ada", "ja": "もう……もう二度と、こんな勝手なことしないで！", "zh": "请你……请你不要再擅自做这种事了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1046_043nor", "source_sha256": "690443cbcb9bcb5449aa58435a47057404007b7127fde821a30f907c5050438c", "ja": "桃子！", "zh": "桃子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1047_037nao", "source_sha256": "e758352927a3675f7a7d7370607332ca1291f9485aeb12dfb9c316288a3364c0", "ja": "桃子、それはアカンて……！", "zh": "桃子，你这样不行啦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1048_p", "source_sha256": "60ec1de706c7f3832cc97c07e054def1232074e90a15562be2372bc04e9f578f", "ja": "桃子……亜利沙、みんなも落ち着いてくれ。\n桃子は、ちょっと……驚いただけだよな？", "zh": "桃子……亚利沙，大家冷静一点。\n桃子你应该……只是有点吓到了而已吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1050_028ari", "source_sha256": "7b80cb3ac3b3605e27ad8b123bcd8078d26c32df6060619299ec6e3dfd9f398c", "ja": "{$P$}さん……だ、大丈夫です！\n遅刻したのは、ありさが悪いので……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……没、没关系的！\n是亚利沙不应该迟到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1051_028ari", "source_sha256": "09394bb3822b576555045cec4175da2c97066e984381df987422f59f63866dac", "ja": "あの……ありさ、レッスンウェアに、\n着替えてきますね……！", "zh": "那个……亚利沙去换训练课程服……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1052_p", "source_sha256": "af05c85f4af7994ed7eba6525476ff7257ae70ad6fa4ee7bca0558955fa14e08", "ja": "亜利沙！", "zh": "亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1053_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1054_001har", "source_sha256": "cb61a93bffeeeb7bf86e056821c609a55808e9968b69ec0ac681ca0df41f850e", "ja": "あれ、亜利沙ちゃん？", "zh": "咦，亚利沙？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1055_p", "source_sha256": "01c20a3115957303426e8d729f66baf754ae6c868b3ee676f743c82933a9be48", "ja": "春香？\n今日は遅れるって……。", "zh": "春香？\n你不是说今天会晚点到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1056_001har", "source_sha256": "b2dad90e49989e0355cf24a9cea4e7cca3012747e0404acd81faac00ec73ec49", "ja": "はい、予定より早くお仕事が終わったんです！\nそれより今、亜利沙ちゃんが……。", "zh": "对呀，但工作比预定的时间提早结束了。\n话说刚刚亚利沙她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1060_001har", "source_sha256": "a8e8b56cd924232540ba0499bb00d903b54a45296d8ec68d95c2635062a8c89b", "ja": "みんな……？", "zh": "大家……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1061_001har", "source_sha256": "44421ab3d633ad0ac61baf417471c921aee4f7db445bcf28063bf779846ff6b9", "ja": "えっと、何があったのかはわからないけど……\nとりあえず甘いものでも食べて、元気出そっか！", "zh": "呃，虽然我不知道发生了什么事情……\n总之先吃点甜食，打起精神来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1062_001har", "source_sha256": "35a624165221db0514b28f91d22c0a514fe26b536ce3b45f6b10d9016ce6d22c", "ja": "ほら、ライブ本番も近いんだし、ね？\nまずは顔を上げて～、はいっ♪", "zh": "而且正式演唱会也快到了，对吧？\n先抬起头来吧～来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1063_037nao", "source_sha256": "6371c880bf2be3bfa0ecc0d0977d61171dedfdd664552edcbac5a478b7a3a508", "ja": "これは……。", "zh": "这是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1064_043nor", "source_sha256": "186bbebb34f314f22fb426a31009002296f3a9d04ae5f2c58137496b17408737", "ja": "マドレーヌ……？", "zh": "玛德莲蛋糕……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1065_001har", "source_sha256": "2bfaab9cc627d66fdab6fa2a3671ca455985e0011e60a750ee2c0f07e2b25e1a", "ja": "お腹が減ってると、怒りっぽくなっちゃうよね。\n……はい、桃子ちゃんにも♪", "zh": "如果肚子饿了就会容易生气嘛。\n……来，桃子也来一块♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1067_037nao", "source_sha256": "52baf8a813579621fa5fafbf5acb812804de7657c82b927d831f213ea3c583b3", "ja": "ん……せやな。これ食べて、気合い入れ直すわ。\nありがとうな、春香！", "zh": "嗯……嘿呀，吃了这个之后重新提起干劲吧。\n谢谢你啊，春香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1068_043nor", "source_sha256": "a7f86efd3d592af9eb6ffe1142043b6781df78e02f188d004440231a63ffe23e", "ja": "よっしゃ！　気持ち切り替えていくよーっ！", "zh": "好！转换心情继续加油吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1070_001har", "source_sha256": "47e6c7a602ce745b9729689c6c289c7d0bbc6365d1a79f4beda5274331b4a427", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。\n私、ちょっとだけ行ってきますね？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生，\n我去看一下状况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1071_p", "source_sha256": "2e16d5b41799048ccedcb9c7a2d8a929c80ce32c87fa620e5d2916dac6cc2872", "ja": "いや、待ってくれ春香。\n俺も行くから。", "zh": "等等，春香。\n我也一起去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_04_1072_001har", "source_sha256": "f9384068d8ef64586e102b8690994e23fd8037369edae78b507385c459bf2789", "ja": "……はい！", "zh": "……好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
